+# Pulseboard
+
+> A confirmation-first web workflow that turns meeting transcripts into owned, dated action items.
+
+**Status**: Project specification complete · Planning has not started.
+
+## What is this?
+
+Pulseboard helps weekly-meeting facilitators review transcript-derived action proposals, confirm an owner and due date, and measure whether teams are improving follow-through during a five-team pilot. It is not a meeting recorder, calendar replacement, or autonomous message sender.
+
+## Project vision
+
+See the canonical [project specification](specs/projects/001-pulseboard/project.md). The next phase is project clarification, followed by the Build-level contract and planning flow.
